  "question": {
    "text": "The frequency of vibration <math><mi>f</mi></math> of a mass m suspended from a spring of spring constant k is given by a relation of the type <math><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> where c is a dimensionless constant. The values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi></math> are"
  },
